  "returns": "\n\n                    <p>A dictionary of selected fields and their values.</p>\n                    <p>Available fields:\n                \n    \n    <ul>\n        \n            <li>\n                <p>Primary:</p>\n                \n    \n    \n    <ul>\n        \n        <li >\n            \n                <p><b>id</b> -\n                    ID of a user;</p>\n            \n            \n        </li>\n        \n        <li >\n            \n                <p><b>first_name</b> -\n                    First name;</p>\n            \n            \n        </li>\n        \n        <li >\n            \n                <p><b>last_name</b> -\n                    Last name;</p>\n            \n            \n        </li>\n        \n        <li >\n            \n                <p><b>email</b> -\n                    email of a user.</p>\n            \n            \n        </li>\n        \n    </ul>\n\n            </li>\n        \n            <li>\n                <p>Secondary:</p>\n                \n    \n    \n    <ul>\n        \n        <li >\n            \n                <p><b>institution</b> - Institution that user is assigned to.</p>\n\n                \n\n                \n                    <p>This field references objects returned by\n                    <a href='https://usosapps.vistula.edu.pl/developers/api/services/mobility/#institution'>institution</a> method. See its <b>returns</b> section\n                    for possible subfields\n                    (only <b>primary</b> are allowed).</p>\n                \n            \n            \n        </li>\n        \n    </ul>\n\n            </li>\n        \n    </ul>\n</p>",
